sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Lightkeeper publisher
    participant B as MQTT broker
    participant H as Home Assistant
    P->>B: CONNECT with Last Will (availability = offline, retained)
    P->>B: discovery configs (retained), availability = online (retained)
    loop every refresh
        P->>B: state JSON (not retained)
        B->>H: sensors update: level, glucose, age, last reading
    end
    alt publisher dies or loses power
        B->>H: Last Will: availability = offline
        H->>H: sensors show unavailable
    else updates stop for another reason
        H->>H: expire_after passes, sensors show unavailable
    end
    Note over P,H: the glucose number is blank whenever the level is STALE or NO DATA
